    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Project S.A.R.A</i></strong> is a first-person psychological thriller set in an isolated firewatch tower deep in the mountains. You play as a man escaping the grief of losing his wife by taking a solitary job in the wilderness. What begins as a quiet escape slowly unravels into a haunting mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only lifeline is a walkie-talkie connecting you to someone named Sara. As your days in the tower pass, strange events begin to unfold\u2014objects move on their own, shadows appear where they shouldn\u2019t, and the forest seems to watch your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no combat, no maps, and no jump scares, the horror comes from atmosphere, isolation, and the unsettling sense that you're being drawn into something you don\u2019t fully understand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alone in the forest, your only lifeline is a mysterious voice on the radio. What secrets lie beyond the door?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717660/extras/67cb989dba47e702bffe686670983b17.poster.avif?t=1754676071\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717660/extras/67cb989dba47e702bffe686670983b17.webm?t=1754676071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717660/extras/67cb989dba47e702bffe686670983b17.mp4?t=1754676071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strange frequencies. Distorted voices. Reality is starting to slip</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717660/extras/0af9d433dff6ac735113c56fc953c8ac.poster.avif?t=1754676071\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717660/extras/0af9d433dff6ac735113c56fc953c8ac.webm?t=1754676071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717660/extras/0af9d433dff6ac735113c56fc953c8ac.mp4?t=1754676071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Someone \u2013 or something \u2013 was here. But there\u2019s no sign of them leaving.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717660/extras/e9f9651405e6fc2714df59c451cc4fa7.poster.avif?t=1754676071\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717660/extras/e9f9651405e6fc2714df59c451cc4fa7.webm?t=1754676071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717660/extras/e9f9651405e6fc2714df59c451cc4fa7.mp4?t=1754676071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key\u00a0Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Narrative Experience</strong><br>Communicate with Sara via walkie-talkie and uncover a story that explores loss, memory, and what it means to be alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic First-Person Gameplay</strong><br>Perform your daily tasks\u2014monitor the radio, start the generator, prepare meals, and maintain the tower. The mundane becomes eerie as days pass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong><br>Discover clues in handwritten notes, personal items, and unexplained events. Pay attention to your surroundings\u2014nothing is shown twice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Tension Without Combat</strong><br>No weapons, no enemies\u2014just unsettling quiet, creeping dread, and the slow distortion of your reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtle Paranormal Elements</strong><br>Experience strange phenomena grounded in psychological realism. The horror isn\u2019t loud\u2014it\u2019s personal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo-Developed Game</strong><br>Built with care to deliver a focused and immersive story-driven experience that respects your attention and imagination.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Project S.A.R.A</i></strong> is a first-person psychological thriller set in an isolated firewatch tower deep in the mountains. You play as a man escaping the grief of losing his wife by taking a solitary job in the wilderness. What begins as a quiet escape slowly unravels into a haunting mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only lifeline is a walkie-talkie connecting you to someone named Sara. As your days in the tower pass, strange events begin to unfold\u2014objects move on their own, shadows appear where they shouldn\u2019t, and the forest seems to watch your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no combat, no maps, and no jump scares, the horror comes from atmosphere, isolation, and the unsettling sense that you're being drawn into something you don\u2019t fully understand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alone in the forest, your only lifeline is a mysterious voice on the radio. What secrets lie beyond the door?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717660/extras/67cb989dba47e702bffe686670983b17.poster.avif?t=1754676071\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717660/extras/67cb989dba47e702bffe686670983b17.webm?t=1754676071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717660/extras/67cb989dba47e702bffe686670983b17.mp4?t=1754676071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strange frequencies. Distorted voices. Reality is starting to slip</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717660/extras/0af9d433dff6ac735113c56fc953c8ac.poster.avif?t=