thout Combat</strong><br>No weapons, no enemies\u2014just unsettling quiet, creeping dread, and the slow distortion of your reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtle Paranormal Elements</strong><br>Experience strange phenomena grounded in psychological realism. The horror isn\u2019t loud\u2014it\u2019s personal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo-Developed Game</strong><br>Built with care to deliver a focused and immersive story-driven experience that respects your attention and imagination.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A man who has lost his wife and seeks to escape loneliness and grief begins working as a firewatch in a forest. He meets a girl named Sarah and encounters strange occurrences while uncovering deep family secrets. He learns that not every voice is human and not every farewell signifies an end.",
